  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There have been many changes to the avatar menu in the recent update and not a single one was in any way a smart idea. All they have done is remove features, make things more difficult, or just make things uglier. Some of the changes in the newest update are as follows: The avatar menu defaults to the marketplace instead of favorite avatars, the pre-existing order of avatars has been scrambled, the game no longer saves how you want to sort specific avatar menus, it is clunkier to unfavorite avatars, it no longer shows the avatar icon in the details menu, the avatar menu no longer has the eye height without clicking \"details\", it no longer shows the ratio of favorited avatars/total slots, the tabs for the different avatar lists are harder to read and conflict with other menus, the public and legacy avatars are in a harder to get to place, and I can't find how to change my fallback anywhere. I recommend undoing every single change made to the avatar menu and putting the new avatar market in the marketplace tab.",
